Subject: [PATCH] Parallelize spawn chunk filtering

Player-spawn chunk filtering scans every player-ticking chunk before the parallel chunk phase. Cache its spatial plan and filter independent player clusters under bounded region leases, then preserve the original chunk order when collecting the results.

